  "body": "Nestled on one of Auckland's most sought-after streets, renowned for its premium properties, this elevated, north-facing section spans nearly 1000m². It boasts sweeping, unobstructed views across Hobson Bay towards the city skyline and Mt Eden.\r\n\r\nThe potential is outstanding. Remove the existing solid 1930s four-bedroom character home that sits high on the elevated sunny site to create the perfect setting to build your grand dream family mansion. \r\n\r\nWhatever your plans, it’s an amazing development site for a project or if you’re an investor you may want to keep the land for the future and take advantage of the capital gain. You could not find a better, more convenient location than this. Orakei Basin, Orakei Bay Village stores and Hobson Bay and Orakei Marina are a stroll away and Auckland’s finest city beaches – Kohimarama and Mission Bay are in close proximity with Newmarket, Remuera and top private schools handy too. \r\n\r\nMove fast or lose the opportunity of a lifetime.",
